  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vsyAipV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"470\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:180px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HHe76Ki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"82\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">開始你的花園！Sprout 是一個旨在增強 Minecraft 農業系統的模組！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sprout/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看 Forge 和 Fabric 版本請點此。</a></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;這個模組新增了什麼？</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">大象 - 生成於草原，可用花生馴服，在附近水源飲水後會為周圍植物澆水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">彈跳蟲 - 生成於緋紅森林和扭曲森林，可被裝瓶使用，促進附近地獄疣和蘑菇生長。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">花生作物 - 在草原發現的新農作物，可收穫與種植。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">多種食物 - 新增派、餅乾、果醬和三明治（1.4.0 版本後已移至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozy</a>）<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雜交育種 - 製作花箱，在兩端各放置一朵花，可獲得 16 種顏色的原版花朵！</span></li>\n</ul><div>&nbsp;</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🌷&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord！</a></span>&nbsp;🌷</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p><p><br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;製作團隊：</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 Frogipher#4778 (美術)</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001 (程式)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;🔗 Ebyc#2022 (動畫)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;💻 CodexAddrian#5885 (Sprout 1.1.0 之前的程式)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 🔗 Condorcrest#8406 (1.19 版本之前的動畫)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;只要註明出處，Sprout 可用於模組包、YouTube 影片等。</span></p>",
